# This file documents the input map setup needed for Stellar Base
# Add these actions in Project > Project Settings > Input Map in Godot Editor
# Or they will be configured via code at runtime

# move_forward - W key / Left stick up
# move_back    - S key / Left stick down
# move_left    - A key / Left stick left
# move_right   - D key / Left stick right
# jump         - Space / Cross button
# interact     - E key / Square button
# sprint       - Shift / L3
# ui_cancel    - Escape / Circle button
